---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Copyright Policy - JKSPDC"
  description="Copyright Policy for the official JKSPDC website. Information about permitted use, reproduction rights, and attribution requirements."
>
  <div class="space-y-0">
    <div class="page-header-band animate-fadeInUp">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="current">Copyright Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Copyright Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 prose-gov space-y-5">

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-4 text-xs text-amber-800 font-semibold">
          ⚠️ <strong>DRAFT — FOR JKSPDC LEGAL REVIEW AND FORMAL APPROVAL BEFORE PUBLICATION.</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">1. Copyright Ownership</h2>
          <p>All content published on this website, including but not limited to text, graphics, photographs, logos, audio clips, video clips, data compilations, and documents, is the copyright of <strong>Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</strong> or the <strong>Government of Jammu &amp; Kashmir</strong>, unless otherwise stated.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">This website is an official Government publication and is protected under applicable Indian copyright laws, including the <strong>Copyright Act, 1957</strong> and its subsequent amendments.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">2. Permitted Use</h2>
          <p>You may reproduce, copy, or use content from this website for the following purposes without prior written permission, provided appropriate attribution is given:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>✅ Personal, non-commercial use</li>
            <li>✅ Educational or research purposes</li>
            <li>✅ News reporting and journalism (with attribution)</li>
            <li>✅ Parliamentary and governmental use</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">3. Restricted Use</h2>
          <p>The following uses of content from this website are <strong>not permitted</strong> without prior written approval from JKSPDCL:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>❌ Commercial reproduction or publication</li>
            <li>❌ Use of the JKSPDCL logo, name, or official emblem</li>
            <li>❌ Misrepresentation of content as original work</li>
            <li>❌ Distribution of content in a modified form without acknowledgement</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">4. Attribution Requirement</h2>
          <p>When reproducing content from this website, the following attribution should be used:</p>
          <blockquote class="mt-2 p-3 bg-gray-50 border-l-4 border-[#0B4F9C] text-sm italic">
            Source: Official Website of Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL), [URL], [Date of Access]
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">5. Third-Party Content</h2>
          <p>Some content on this website may be subject to third-party copyright. Where such content is used, appropriate attribution is provided. For third-party content, please contact the original rights holder for permission to reproduce.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">6. Copyright Infringement</h2>
          <p>If you believe any content on this website infringes your copyright, please notify us with:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• Your contact details</li>
            <li>• Description of the copyrighted work</li>
            <li>• URL of the allegedly infringing content</li>
            <li>• A statement of good faith</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">Contact: <a href="mailto:md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in</a></p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">
          <strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 2026 | <strong>Last Reviewed:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long' })}
        </p>

      </article>

      <aside class="space-y-5">
        <div class="card-static">
          <h3 class="sidebar-card-title">Legal &amp; Policies</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <li><a href="/terms-conditions" class="sidebar-link">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></li>
            <li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="sidebar-link">Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/disclaimer" class="sidebar-link">Disclaimer</a></li>
            <li><a href="/hyperlinking-policy" class="sidebar-link">Hyperlinking Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/accessibility-statement" class="sidebar-link">Accessibility Statement</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
